{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXBGCC02V9QB94NCQB","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXXJDANCMBNZ51BT8E","name_zh":"命運排斥","name_en":"Karmic Retribution","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"魔劍士","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":6,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 6，魔劍士 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"","casting_time":"","range":"","target":"","area":"","effect":"","duration":"","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"此法術效果與 天運靈光（Karmic Aura ）相當，除了傷害你的生物在意志豁免失敗時將\n陷入暈眩，持續 1 輪。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[673,673],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"a32a11a9d3def3853b889119fbab16a080213f6474251008d3f19f968e2f87dd","heading":"命運排斥（Karmic Retribution）（完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXMDJM9B7QEF8H8PAZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXNBX9TXGWF2QMRHJJ","name_zh":"銳鋒術","name_en":"Keen Edge","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 英尺+5 英尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一件武器，或五十件投射物，在施法的時候所有這些投射物都必須互相接觸","area":"","effect":"","duration":"10 分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效（無害，物體）","spell_resistance":"可（無害，物體）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術可以使一件武器鋒利異常，提升其重擊能力。 此法術使武器的重擊範圍加倍。\n原重擊範圍為 20 者變為 19-20，原為 19-20 者變為 17-20，原為 18-20 者變為 15-20。 此法\n術只能施展在穿刺或揮砍武器上。 如果施展在箭或矢上，那麼無論是否擊中目標，這支箭矢上\n的銳鋒術都會中止。（在這個法術的使用中，視手裡劍為箭類武器，而非投擲武器。）\n多種增加武器重擊範圍的效果（例如銳鋒術和精通重擊專長）不能相疊加。 你不能將\n此法術施展在天生武器上，比如爪抓。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[673,674],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c213df30591a7e13fce0f58ece606702d12225c3ef7e915a4d619df405a199fa","heading":"銳鋒術（Keen Edge）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEY5TY306H95P8V7T0J","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEY1TZE2XRMJ1N26MGZ","name_zh":"卡魯古爾火焰彈","name_en":"Kelgore’s Fire Bolt","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["PHB2"],"explicit_sources":["PHB2"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["PHB2"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"暮刃","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"暮刃 1，術士/法師 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系/塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":["火焰"],"components":"言語、姿勢、材料","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 呎+10 呎/每等級）","target":"單一生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"反射通過則減半","spell_resistance":"見敘述","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你召來一小塊熾熱的岩石並猛力擲向一個目標，一圈帶著細碎爆裂聲的秘法能量伴隨著\n岩石急速穿過空氣。此法術能召來一小塊岩石並將秘法能量包覆其上。此法術能造成每施法者\n等級 1d6 點火焰傷害（最高 5d6）。若你無法穿透生物的法術抗力，岩石的熱度與衝擊力量\n仍能造成 1d6 點火焰傷害。\n施法材料：一把燃燒後殘留的灰燼。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[674,674],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"bd6085ab30eea82834c6eedec411ac353785a8ccb8776401e70d996a3e8c0255","heading":"卡魯古爾火焰彈（Kelgore’s Fire Bolt）（PHB2）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYW8W88H82E5Q28YNY","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEY08ZB9S2GAKFAE8SQ","name_zh":"卡魯古爾墓窖寒霧","name_en":"Kelgore’s Grave Mist","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["PHB2"],"explicit_sources":["PHB2"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["PHB2"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系/死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["寒冷"],"components":"言語、姿勢、材料","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 呎+10 呎/每等級）","target":"","area":"半徑 20 擴散範圍，高度 20 呎","effect":"","duration":"一輪/每等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"見敘述","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"憑藉著法術姿勢，你創造出一團濕冷細薄的煙霧。隨著霧氣的出現，範圍內的光線也黯\n淡下來，煙霧範圍內吹送的微風讓你背椎發涼。\n此法術讓你能在法術範圍內創造一團薄霧。由於霧氣過於稀薄，因此對視線沒有任何影\n響，但在其中的死靈能量會束縛範圍內的所有活物。所有在薄霧範圍內的活體生物會陷入疲乏\n狀態，此外每輪會受到 1d6 點寒冷傷害。若你無法穿透生物的法術抗力，那目標仍會受到\n寒冷傷害，但不受疲乏效果影響。\n施法材料：一把取自墓地或墳場的土。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[674,674],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"64c1dc88ae8f77e8ccf137d92129803ee0986bdce8234b547598144a48fd826a","heading":"卡魯古爾墓窖寒霧（Kelgore’s Grave Mist）（PHB2）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYJP2EV5P3VK4Y2NVF","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYRCRVNM2R65QWM7FY","name_zh":"海藻之絞","name_en":"Kelpstrand","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"創造","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S、M","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"每 3 級一個相隔 30 尺以內的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一回合/每等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"無","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你伸出你的手指,一段濕海帶（= =!!）伸出來包圍你的敵人\n向你的敵人作一個遠端接觸攻擊 ,如果擊中的話 ,你可以立即以自由動作作一個不會被借\n機攻擊的擒抱檢定;你的擒抱檢定為你的施法者等級+感知加值。若你成功, 目標會被一條海\n帶捆綁,每回合目標可以對海帶作出擒抱對抗檢定或逃脫術檢定。一般而言 ,你施展這法術時\n不會對自己作出擒抱。你不能作任何動作若你想維持此法術\n若物件被多個海帶捆綁,他需要對每條海帶作出一次逃脫術檢定。當你在離海洋 300 尺\n以內施展此法術時,你的海帶的擒抱檢定+4\n施法材料：一片幹海帶","description_en":null,"source_pages":[674,675],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3a404b1dd666c920ee2a4353b045c477734876293b42cbf20473a83e1f208b01","heading":"海藻之絞（Kelpstrand） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEY266GQAN3ZGEPJZ5E","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYRVFNK6C4AK784P4M","name_zh":"龍的蔑視輕拍","name_en":"Kiss Of Draconic Defiance","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"unresolved_expansion","sources":["龍之魔法"],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":["龍之魔法"],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"40 英尺","target":"","area":"40 英尺半徑，以你為中心彌漫。","effect":"","duration":"專注+1 回合，或直到消耗為止","saving_throw":"強韌，通過則無效；看下文 法術","spell_resistance":"可；看下文","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"發光的能量環在你的身體上旋轉，粉碎了他人的魔法能量。\n這個法術使你的身體向外放射出魔法干擾，使得法術範圍內的其他人更難施法。任何試\n圖在法術範圍內施法的敵人必須成功通過強韌豁免；失敗就意味著失去該法術（如同它被施\n放了）且不造成任何效果。任何成功通過用於對抗該法術的豁免的生物在此後的 24 小時之\n內對它的效果免疫。一個生物第一次試圖在法術範圍內施法時要進行法術抗力檢定。\n此外，在法術有效期間，你能通過一個直覺動作（如同反制法術動作）自動反制一個 5\n級以下的法術，只要該施法者在法術範圍內。這樣做會使法術持續時間立即結束。你無需為了\n反制其它法術而消耗你自己的法術位，也無需進行法術辨識檢定以辨認它（然而你可以選擇\n這樣做以確定它不高於 5 級。）","description_en":null,"source_pages":[676,676],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":["source_inferred_not_relational"],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"775a6cbe15d5f90e2338e854dea1b36da685011749216d1b3d4dbc1fc1aa17a7","heading":"龍的蔑視輕拍（Kiss Of Draconic Defiance）（龍之魔法）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEY786HQ8E4CZ988MWT","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYV3H1S5W5MX9G4PQV","name_zh":"吸血鬼之吻","name_en":"Kiss Of The Vampire","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V,S,M","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"自己","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一回合/每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"死靈力量令你獲得如周吸血鬼一般的特性,你的眼睛變成血紅,皮膚變得蒼白和憔悴\n你得到傷害抵抗 10/魔法,並獲得以下的視為標準動作的效果:\n 弱能術（Enervation）,視為近程接觸攻擊\n 吸血鬼之觸（Vampiric Touch）,視為近程接觸攻擊\n 魅惑人類（Charm Person）\n 氣化形體（Gaseous Form）,只限自己\n當你用此法術時,造成傷害（Inflict）法術會治療你,而治療傷害（Cure）法術會傷害你。\n所有法術和效果對你都會視為不死生物。你成功地變身後 ,若你對抗不死生物,你投完攻擊骰\n後,你需要過一個意志豁免（DC=10+魅力加值）,或者你恐慌（panicked）（或恐懼（cowering））\n10 回合。若你消滅一個不死生物,你投完攻擊骰後,你需要過一個意志豁免（DC=15+魅力加\n值）,或者你震懾（stunned）（或迷惑（charm）如同被施展了 charm monster）10 回合\n由此法術產生的魅惑效果都會在此法術效果終結時終結 ,但影響依然殘留著\n施法材料：一個刻有尖牙咀巴的黑瑪瑙（價值 50GP）","description_en":null,"source_pages":[675,676],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"68dcd32c5df19bb896216c29764bfb6edf13265539de03a5c569ce69c69057f5","heading":"吸血鬼之吻（Kiss Of The Vampire ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYX60MH7REZ0BS80M7","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYQ62M546VCQE0KN43","name_zh":"蟾蜍之吻","name_en":"Kiss of Toad","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美奧術"],"explicit_sources":["完美奧術"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美奧術"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巫覡","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"巫覡 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，法器","casting_time":"單動作","range":"接觸","target":"","area":"","effect":"被接觸的活物","duration":"","saving_throw":"強韌，通過則無效；見說明","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的接觸變得蘊含毒性，以一個成功的近戰接觸攻擊檢定在一個生物上施毒。毒會造成\n1d6 體質傷害，並在 1 分鐘之後再造成 1d6 體質傷害。任何一次傷害都可以在成功的強韌檢\n定後被忽略。\n施法器材：一塊在你皮膚上的蟾蜍紋身","description_en":null,"source_pages":[675,675],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"9f851b868f14804f12082a90595f35118087ea73a0c4b34086ffaa992a63ce6f","heading":"蟾蜍之吻（Kiss of Toad）（完美奧術）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYEJSMDB8FD9WCHWAF","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEY3BHWW7FDE1SM21E0","name_zh":"騎兵突擊","name_en":"Knight's Move","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"聖武士","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 3,聖武士 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"傳送","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S,DF","casting_time":"一個迅捷動作","range":"5 尺/每 2 等級;見說明","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"即時","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"地面變得像是棋盤一樣,部份方格微微泛紅,若你不走指定的地點,你將會被時間停止\n你可以用移動在短距離內作出精密傳送,你可以移動每 2 施法者等級 5 尺,但此移動必需\n以正斜線離開你附近的敵人","description_en":null,"source_pages":[676,676],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"0df4dcd6ac7636fa9a513ff5884d237c05ab1456e99dd4b369665d04ca794c1e","heading":"騎兵突擊（Knight's Move） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEY3PN6RWXQCANWE0TZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYWWWMKZM124CHQYHM","name_zh":"敲擊術","name_en":"Knock","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 英尺/每等級）","target":"一扇門，一個箱子或盒子，面積不超過 10 平方英尺/每等級","area":"","effect":"","duration":"瞬間；見下文","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"敲擊術可以打開被卡住、閂住、鎖住、 封住以及被秘法鎖（Arcane Lock）鎖住的門。它\n可以打開密門，也可以打開上鎖的盒子或密件箱。也可以用來鬆開焊縫、鐐銬或者鎖鏈（前提是\n它們保持閉合狀態）。 此法術不能移除秘法鎖，只是使其在 10 分鐘能失去作用。 在所有其\n他的情況下，被打開的門都不會自行再次鎖住或是卡住。敲擊術不能使抬起木柵城門 或者類似\n的障礙（例如鐵閘門），它也不能影響繩索、藤蔓之類的東西。 法術效果受法術區域的限\n制。 每次施法可以移除兩種阻礙門打開的原因。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[676,677],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"8365c7fa6fd49374cabc7903971bea01cbffe90a4c6a0ac714e5cf8184661d0a","heading":"敲擊術（Knock）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYSFG6B1B4WDWAD0MR","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEY4B5ZERKR0B09ZAVS","name_zh":"指北術","name_en":"Know Direction","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":0,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":0,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 0，德魯伊 0","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你可以得知哪個方向是北方。 此法術在任何存在“北方”概念的環境中都有效，但是\n在異界中可能失去效果。 此法術只是在你施展的瞬間使你知道北方的位置，如果你沒有借\n助參照物來保持確定方向的話，你有可能再次迷失方向。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[677,677],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"0f0db3cb9b0d2928aec87f5e0c61dcafef557333f2d6d11dd33fbfec8e4404b4","heading":"指北術（Know Direction ）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEY6PB9FMSYS0GDF06D","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYD987WK9X68R1MHQT","name_zh":"解析強者","name_en":"know Greatest Enemy","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"聖武士","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"黑暗守衛","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"黑暗守衛 1,聖武士 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、DF","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"60 尺","target":"錐形爆發","area":"","effect":"","duration":"專注,最多為每等級一回合","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的眼睛發出綠光,然後轉變成金色,你對對手作出一次檢視,最弱的為蒼白色,然後依次\n上升,最強者會被一個翠綠色的光環環繞著\n這個法術對範圍內的生物作出評估,生物的評估如下表:\nCR 實力\n4 或以下 弱\n5-10 中等\n11-15 強\n16 或以上 超符想像\n在同一區域範圍內的生物,你知道哪個是最強力的,但不知道為什麼。例如:一群食人魔\n（CR2）內,你知道最強的是一個有 2 級野蠻人等級的食人魔（CR4）,但你不知道這食人魔有\n職業等級,對你的態度,或其他原因\n任何 3 級或以上的防止偵察的法術（如回避偵測（Nondetection）,或虛假景象（False\nVision））都可以防止此法術的評估","description_en":null,"source_pages":[677,678],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"e3ce4738417ed1ae3284eb5047546c11fdbf70f46caaa42e11ee38a87f3f75b9","heading":"解析強者（know Greatest Enemy ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEYR47Y6QS7YWRA7GRJ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEYJ1VC38WQ43G005Y5","name_zh":"辨析敵手","name_en":"Know Opponent","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 3,牧師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"S,DF","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一個生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"即時","saving_throw":"意志過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的眼睛發出神奇的光芒,法術完成後,你在空氣中看到發光的字樣寫著你希望看到的生\n物的優點和缺點\n你瞭解到對方的長短處,數量為 1+每 2 施 法 者 1 個長處或短處（最多 4 個）,你可以選擇\n去瞭解長處或短處,或者一些你指定的內容。若目標有多於你能夠知道的長 短處，你知道最\n有用的那個。例如:物件能使用死亡一指（Finger of Death）,或音波抗性 5,你會先得知死亡一\n指。\n長處包括攻擊方式,特異能力（包括類法術能力 Sp 或超自然能力 Su）.短處包括能量傷\n害的弱點\n例如,一個 7 級牧師對一個黑裝甲武士（blackarmored warrior）使用此法術,並希望得知\n1 個長處及 2 個短處。而黑裝甲武士的豁免檢定失敗,DM 需要告訴該牧師黑裝甲武士可以吸\n收能量（長處），害怕陽光以及會被神聖標記彈開（短處２個）。牧師於是得出結論為他面臨\n著一個吸血鬼，並打破了木樁。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[678,678],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3cc75a1d45775b2ee040bc7cdc01b6f954c57425ebaa1bad1c5a72a27a528706","heading":"辨析敵手（Know Opponent ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEZSWZB81W6Z04BGZQZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEZX7WWJPN5351K5F2T","name_zh":"解析弱點","name_en":"Know Vulnerabilities","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":4,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 2，牧師 3，術士/法師 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一個生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"即時","saving_throw":"意志過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的眼睛變紅,然後變成金色。當你望向一個生物時,你可以看到一些小符文在他頭上出\n現,每個符文都會告訴你長短處,紅色為長處,綠色為弱點\n你得知對象的能力,長處,和弱點（如有）。弱點包括所有會增加額外傷害地方（就像是一個\n冰屬性的怪物會怕火）,長處包括所有會降低傷害的地方。法術將分開告訴你長處與短處\n例如,如果你對一個巴羅炎魔（balor）使用,你得知物件會傷害抵抗 15/冰冷,鐵,和善良。\n魔法抵抗 26,免疫毒,火焰,和電,並有 10 點酸抵抗和冰抵抗,而沒有什麼特別的弱點。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[678,678],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"04e1fa66dc89707a0397d9c51f17c8f02288094a7731b80e67949ca28ae52939","heading":"解析弱點（Know Vulnerabilities ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEZXPM3SRYMREP277XG","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEZT9157NG18CAF1YXT","name_zh":"寇濤魚人之膚","name_en":"Kuo-Toa Skin","alphabet":"K","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["風暴之書"],"explicit_sources":["風暴之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["風暴之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 1，巡林客 1，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V, S, M/DF","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/等級","saving_throw":"意志通過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"目標的皮膚，衣物，盔甲以及其他個人財產（包括穿戴的魔法物品）都像寇濤魚人滑膩\n的皮膚一樣發出油膩的光澤。在法術持續時間內，目標在脫逃術檢定上獲得+8 加值，並且\n不會被網（無論是否是魔法造成的）所捕獲。\n奧術施法材料：一片寇濤魚人的鱗片。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[678,680],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"e7e52b890b19313c625ebf9ae6d64b56099cbc17cfe0b10d61fbe3cce571791b","heading":"寇濤魚人之膚（Kuo-Toa Skin）（風暴之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
